---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Project information — Caelora" noindex>
  <main id="main" class="container document">
    <span class="eyebrow">Project information</span>
    <h1>A world in development.</h1>
    <p>
      Caelora is an independent native Windows game in development. This website currently presents
      the project vision and concept artwork.
    </p>
    <h2>Community & support</h2>
    <p>
      Official community channels and a support contact have not been published on this site yet.
      There are no official purchase, registration or launcher-download links here.
    </p>
    <h2 id="legal">Legal & privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This foundation does not offer accounts, payments, analytics, advertising or newsletter
      collection. It does not set application cookies. A hosting provider may process access logs
      when this site is deployed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Publisher details, contact information, terms of sale, refund policy and a deployment-specific
      privacy notice must be reviewed and published before commerce, accounts or data collection
      become available.
    </p>
    <p>
      Concept imagery is not gameplay footage. All images may change during development. Third-party
      font licenses are distributed with the project source.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/">
      ← Back to Caelora
    </a>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
